{{JPExclusive}}
'''Cat Giraffe Modoki''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] during the [[JRA Collaboration Event]]. It was added in the [[Version 10.10 Update]]. Like [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]], it is capped at level 1, meaning it can only be upgraded using +levels.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 626
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Cat Giraffe Modoki
|name2 = Suruma Cat Giraffe Modoki
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Suruma Cat Giraffe Modoki''' at level 1+9.

==Strategy/Usage==
The only use for Cat Giraffe Modoki outside of the collab stages and their [[Cat Combo|Combo]] lies in [[User Rank]], as they are completely outclassed by [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] even against Red enemies.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave & Rusher}}

